WEBVTT

00:03:57.395 --> 00:04:00.309
our policies and our culture.

00:04:00.309 --> 00:04:02.374
In the workplace,

00:04:02.374 --> 00:04:05.677
real equality means valuing family

00:04:05.677 --> 00:04:07.300
just as much as work,

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:11.863
and understanding that the two reinforce each other.

00:04:11.863 --> 00:04:13.766
As a leader and as a manager,

00:04:13.766 --> 00:04:16.811
I have always acted on the mantra,

00:04:16.811 --> 00:04:19.091
if family comes first,

00:04:19.091 --> 00:04:21.938
work does not come second --

00:04:21.938 --> 00:04:24.242
life comes together.

00:04:24.242 --> 00:04:28.407
If you work for me, and you have a family issue,

00:04:28.407 --> 00:04:30.841
I expect you to attend to it,